title: 'pallet-session: track consumer refs and release deposits for externally set
  keys'
doc:
- audience: Runtime Dev
  description: |-
    When session keys are set via `SessionInterface` (external path, e.g. from AH),  pallet-session now:
      - skips `inc_consumers/dec_consumers` for externally-set keys, tracked via `ExternallySetKeys` storage map
      - releases any existing key deposit (`HoldReason::Keys`) when the external path takes over from a prior local registration

    This ensures deposits and consumer refs are correctly managed when validators transition between local and external key management.
crates:
- name: pallet-session
  bump: minor
